OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine and then dry
OL,7,Fovernight with prolonged clear periods
OL,8,Fand variable cloud. Staying rather
OL,9,Fwarm in urban areas but considerably
OL,10,Fcooler in the countryside by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FDry and mainly sunny,
OL,13,Falthough wispy high cloud may turn the
OL,14,Fsunshine hazier at times. Notably
OL,15,Fbreezier than on Monday, particularly
OL,16,Fon coasts. A much warmer day though,
OL,17,Fespecially inland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
