OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fand hot or very hot on Wednesday and
OL,7,FThursday, with some warm nights too.
OL,8,FProbably turning less hot on Friday
OL,9,Fwith the outside chance of a shower
OL,10,Flater.
